  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap prose">
      <h2>This website</h2>
      <p>khensu.nu sets no cookies and runs no analytics, trackers or third-party scripts. Pages are static files served through Google Cloud’s content delivery network, which handles your request the way any web host does; we don’t log visits.</p>
      <h2>The app</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Messages, calls, payments and files are post-quantum end-to-end encrypted. Only the people in a conversation can read them.</li>
        <li>The network can’t see who talks to whom, and the people who run it can’t either.</li>
        <li>Search, summaries and answers come from private AI that runs only on your device. There are no AI nodes or servers for your data to leak to.</li>
        <li>No iCloud, no Siri, no server-side processing of any kind. Only you have your data.</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>Questions: <a href="mailto:hello@elliottwave.studio?subject=khensu.nu%20privacy">hello@elliottwave.studio</a>. khensu.nu is made by Elliott Wave LLC.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
